    "detailed_description": "<h1>Don't Forget Add To You Wishlist\uff01</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/fa0b643ad8e866bf4389ce951713818b.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/fa0b643ad8e866bf4389ce951713818b.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist now to be among the first to become a beta tester!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/0ac250bd2b66ed668c17c10cb62f1611.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/0ac250bd2b66ed668c17c10cb62f1611.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span>This is a platforming roguelike game set in a cave filled with various animal factions and monsters. It features platforming, diverse weapons and abilities, boss battles, and character collection. Death isn\u2019t the end; with each challenge, you'll uncover the tumultuous undercurrents beneath the surface of this strange world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.mp4?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/5184d05b5f9c7a02c0bad4907a420117.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/5184d05b5f9c7a02c0bad4907a420117.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underground cave, you'll find a variety of weapons at your disposal: automatic pistols, shotguns, cannons, massive axes, great swords, daggers, magic wands, staves... and even\u2014 a giant carrot?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/4c8049b008469f4fb8f3f4c16b2e3fcc.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/4c8049b008469f4fb8f3f4c16b2e3fcc.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/4c8049b008469f4fb8f3f4c16b2e3fcc.mp4?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/f3d9f98d866184a1e45e224a483310fb.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/f3d9f98d866184a1e45e224a483310fb.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span>The underground... is incredibly deep! It features a range of diverse ecological environments and terrains, all inhabited by powerful monsters and various factions. These inhabitants won\u2019t easily allow you to pass, especially since you\u2019re an uninvited adventurer who may seeking the treasures and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/c98be046ef87c551c537ff98f23ee73b.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/c98be046ef87c551c537ff98f23ee73b.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/c98be046ef87c551c537ff98f23ee73b.mp4?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/312907f316c7f9bdc8a85fd70699232e.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/312907f316c7f9bdc8a85fd70699232e.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span>Rewards and risks go hand in hand! The cave is filled with powerful abilities and treasures in chests just waiting to be discovered\u2014along with secrets, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/eef5d4f2ecc5bba0e9ccce540f0bd380.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/eef5d4f2ecc5bba0e9ccce540f0bd380.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/eef5d4f2ecc5bba0e9ccce540f0bd380.mp4?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/e550f07b641f0b54651ef0ca338446f7.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/e550f07b641f0b54651ef0ca338446f7.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span>*Over a hundred different weapons, each with unique traits and abilities.Experiment with new weapons that combine with talent points and enhancements tomake them more effective in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Nearly a hundred different abilities, each with its own characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Concerned about not finding the right weapons or powerful abilities? Noworries! The talent point system will help balance that out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Talent points didn\u2019t quite go as planned...? Well, you might still find powerful item combinations and weapons suited to your talents. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A world with various &quot;animal&quot; factions: dogs, cats, rabbits, and even mice. Each with their own agendas, each of them with his own axe to grind,they delve underground to uncover treasures and seek the truth.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/0ac250bd2b66ed668c17c10cb62f1611.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/0ac250bd2b66ed668c17c10cb62f1611.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span>This is a platforming roguelike game set in a cave filled with various animal factions and monsters. It features platforming, diverse weapons and abilities, boss battles, and character collection. Death isn\u2019t the end; with each challenge, you'll uncover the tumultuous undercurrents beneath the surface of this strange world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.webm?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/ab31c056fc395fa2bdffbd7330545247.mp4?t=1752739808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/5184d05b5f9c7a02c0bad4907a420117.poster.avif?t=1752739808\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194390/extras/5184d05b5f9c7a02c0bad4907a420117.webp?t=1752739808\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=88 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underground cave, you'll find a variety of weapon