s that combine with talent points and enhancements tomake them more effective in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Nearly a hundred different abilities, each with its own characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Concerned about not finding the right weapons or powerful abilities? Noworries! The talent point system will help balance that out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Talent points didn\u2019t quite go as planned...? Well, you might still find powerful item combinations and weapons suited to your talents. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A world with various &quot;animal&quot; factions: dogs, cats, rabbits, and even mice. Each with their own agendas, each of them with his own axe to grind,they delve underground to uncover treasures and seek the truth.</p>",
